config VIDEO_MT6785_CAMSV
	tristate "MediaTek MT6785 CAMSV raw capture driver"
	depends on VIDEO_DEV
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on OF
	select MEDIA_CONTROLLER
	select VIDEOBUF2_DMA_CONTIG
	select V4L2_FWNODE
	help
	  This is a Video4Linux2 driver for the MediaTek CAMSV capture
	  engines of MT6785, the small raw-frame DMAs next to the closed
	  image signal processor. One video node is created per engine;
	  frames are raw Bayer, written to physically addressed memory
	  through vb2 dma-contig.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called mtk-camsv-mt6785.
